# Core

Follow [`.agents/rules/core.md`](../../.agents/rules/core.md).

Qarve extras:

- Before non-trivial work, read `docs/architecture.md`, then **`doqs/docs/architecture.md`** (submodule; run `git submodule update --init` if missing). Read relevant `architecture/*.sysml`.
- For OTRL/ODRL or naming, read `doqs/docs/readiness-levels.md` and `doqs/docs/naming.md`.
- Before new solutions, read [`.agents-local/skills/patterns/SKILL.md`](../../.agents-local/skills/patterns/SKILL.md) and use the `maintain-patterns` skill.
- Narrative docs use **dated files** in `docs/dev-log/`, `docs/mistakes/`, `docs/decisions/` — templates in `doqs/templates/`.
- After tasks, append to `docs/prompts-log/YYYY-MM.md` per `AGENTS.md` and `prompts-log` rule.
- If `docs/onboarding.md` or living-doc folders are missing, bootstrap from [`.agents/bootstrap/docs/`](../../.agents/bootstrap/docs/) or `doqs/templates/`.
- **Never edit `.FCStd` files** in the agent — CAD geometry is manual in FreeCAD.
